(7027233, 1065386, 97225, '<td valign="top">Congratulations David. Beautifully put together triptych. <br/><i>I have taken the liberty of skewing the perspective of the tall building on the left to make it appear more dramatic.</i> And why not? I''m glad you made such great use of expert editing.</td>', 'Congratulations David. Beautifully put together triptych. I have taken the liberty of skewing the perspective of the tall building on the left to make it appear more dramatic. And why not? I''m glad you made such great use of expert editing.', '2013-04-26 03:49:17.000000', NULL, 0),
