(7027283, 1065139, 12611, '<td valign="top">this is a nice dark and foreboding shot, there is a smooth quality to the shot, and I would agree that elegance is a way to describe it. This is definitely a study in how there can be a great deal of space that doesn''t need to be filled up with detail.</td>', 'this is a nice dark and foreboding shot, there is a smooth quality to the shot, and I would agree that elegance is a way to describe it. This is definitely a study in how there can be a great deal of space that doesn''t need to be filled up with detail.', '2013-04-26 06:55:24.000000', NULL, 0),
